msgstr ""

#: includes/widgets/popup.php:23
msgid "The popup will retain it's initial position regardless of page scroll."
msgstr ""

#: includes/widgets/popup.php:40
msgid "Open By Selector on Hover"
msgstr ""

#: includes/widgets/popup.php:41
msgid ""
"The popup will be triggered when the selector is hovered. When using this "
"feature make sure the <strong>selector</strong> used in the \"Open By "
"Selector\" field is <strong>unique</strong> (use ID when possible) and "
"<strong>not</strong> used to open other Popups. <em>*Does "
"<strong>not</strong> support multiple selectors.</em>"
msgstr ""

#: includes/widgets/popup.php:54
msgid "Close on Hover Away"
msgstr ""

#: includes/widgets/popup.php:55
msgid ""
"The popup will be closed automatically when it loses hover.<br/>If you "
"experience issues with popup flickering when using this option, it's "
"probably related to the \"Overlay\" option. If disabling the \"Overlay\" "
"option is not possible, make sure the overlay doesn't overlap the popup's "
"\"Open Selector\" element."
msgstr ""

#: includes/widgets/popup.php:71
msgid "Align with Selector"
msgstr ""

#: includes/widgets/popup.php:72
msgid ""
"The popup will be positioned relative to the selector (trigger) element. "
"When using this feature make sure the <strong>selector</strong> used in the "
"\"Open By Selector\" field is <strong>unique</strong> (use ID when "
"possible). <em>*Does <strong>not</strong> support multiple selectors.</em>"
msgstr ""

